<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JULY TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT 1200 - NCB.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JULY TRADE DATA DUE TODAY AT 1200 - NCB.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish July foreign trade data will be released today at 1200/1000 GMT, the National Customs Board (NCB) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In June, Finland's trade surplus was 5.82 billion markka, according to NCB data.</p>
<p>The Bank of Finland has estimated the July trade balance at 3.8 billion markka with exports at 13.4 billion markka and imports at 9.6 billion markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
